manufacturing services in the United States, the Asia-Pacific, Europe, the Middle East, and Africa. The company offers design, develop, supply chain, new product introduction, and manufacturing solutions, as well as sustaining services. It serves the aerospace/defense, healthcare/life sciences, and industrial/commercial sectors. Plexus Corp. was founded in 1979 and is headquartered in Neenah, Wisconsin.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Todd P. Kelsey | President, CEO & Director | Age 60 | Compensation: $3.1M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 25K people. Revenue per employee of $199K ranks in the bottom quartile among Technology peers, with revenue growing 6%/yr across its filed history. Stock-based compensation of $2K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 15\u00d7 revenue per employee (reasonable relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags low compensation governance risk (1/10).","financial_summary":["Plexus Corp. is a mid-cap technology business with a $5.2B market cap on $5.0B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +5% over the past three years and +7% annually across the full decade, which puts it in mature, slow-growth territory.","Returns on capital run at 18% against a 9% cost of capital, a 9-point spread that creates value, though narrow enough that competitive pressure could close it, and 9% gross margins are typical of commodity economics where competitors can replicate the product cheaply.","The company is burning through $29M of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and interest coverage of 17\u00d7 is fortress-like.","Shareholder yield is only 1.7%, a thin return of capital, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome, and profit capture is only 0.2\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Price sits 61% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left, and the cushion against estimate error has been bid away","sev":"red","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.6134283315839314},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Piotroski score 4/9 \u2014 below the median for a healthy business","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $3.9M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"Gross margin trails most Technology peers \u2014 competitors appear to have the pricing hand","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Technology peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Technology sector lagging the market significantly, underperforming by 9% over 3 months","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Technology ETF trading well below its long-term trend","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Elevated sector volatility (52% annualized) adds uncertainty","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Cybersecurity liability and talent cost inflation \u2014 a single breach can erase years of goodwill, and the war for engineering talent compresses margins even at scale.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Plexus (PLXS) Down 13% Since Last Earnings Report: Can It Rebound?","source":"zacks.com","link":"https://www.zacks.com/stock/news/3036687/plexus-plxs-down-13-since-last-earnings-report-can-it-rebound?cid=CS-ZC-FT-realtime_blog-3036687","date":"2026-11-27","timestamp":1795793423.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Plexus (PLXS) Stock Is Down 8.9% Today Without Company News","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.co